<font size="64">So you just tried it on me once.</font>

20
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:37,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam just tried fighting since he was feeling good.)</font>

21
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Turning)</font>

22
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,280
