<font size="64">- The pressure point? - In case his blood pressure spiked.</font>

31
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,320
<font size="64">- You should press it. - Sure.</font>

32
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,890
<font size="64">You can't start shouting out of nowhere.</font>

33
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:54,760
