392
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:10,110
<font size="64">He's here!</font>

393
00:11:10,210 --> 00:11:11,810
<font size="64">- Min Jong! - Hello.</font>

394
00:11:10,410 --> 00:11:13,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jee Seok Sam somehow managed to find his way here.)</font>

395
00:11:13,210 --> 00:11:14,980
<font size="64">I ended up stumbling upon this place by accident.</font>

396
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,610
<font size="64">Hey, Min Jong.</font>

397
00:11:15,810 --> 00:11:18,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji and Jee are lucky today.)</font>

398
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:18,420
<font size="64">- Have you been well? - Yes, I've been fine.</font>

399
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:20,180
<font size="64">- It's been a while. - I watched your match.</font>

400
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:24,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Squeezing)</font>

401
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:22,950
<font size="64">You're unbelievable.</font>

402
00:11:22,950 --> 00:11:24,020
<font size="64">You're really big.</font>

403
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:26,220
<font size="64">- What is this? I smell kimchi stew. - He made kimchi stew.</font>

404
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Min Jong has 2 people...)</font>

405
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:28,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(with only 1 spot left.)</font>

406
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:27,590
<font size="64">Kimchi stew.</font>

407
00:11:29,490 --> 00:11:32,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok, who headed the other way...)</font>

408
00:11:29,690 --> 00:11:30,800
<font size="64">Is it over there?</font>

409
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,500
<font size="64">Where is it?</font>

410
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:34,030
<font size="64">I don't think we should go this way.</font>

411
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:37,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Wandering around in the middle of nowhere)</font>

412
00:11:35,130 --> 00:11:36,630
<font size="64">I've come all this way for nothing.</font>

413
00:11:37,370 --> 00:11:38,670
<font size="64">Is this a dead end?</font>

414
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:43,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Antennas have broken antennas today.)</font>

415
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,010
<font size="64">No!</font>

416
00:11:46,940 --> 00:11:48,510
<font size="64">This is the wrong path.</font>

417
00:11:48,780 --> 00:11:50,110
<font size="64">When you take the wrong path,</font>

418
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:52,250
<font size="64">you just make a map.</font>

419
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:54,550
<font size="64">The wrong path</font>

420
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:55,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sneaking in a little promotion)</font>

421
00:11:55,050 --> 00:11:58,520
<font size="64">Creates a map</font>

422
00:11:55,950 --> 00:11:59,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Panting in between)</font>

423
00:11:59,020 --> 00:12:01,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Yang In Ha is dedicated to promoting the song.)</font>

424
00:12:00,290 --> 00:12:01,360
<font size="64">This isn't it.</font>

425
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:04,960
<font size="64">I saw a bunch of flowers in front of Min Jong earlier.</font>

426
00:12:01,930 --> 00:12:04,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, Jong Kook was wandering around looking for flowers.)</font>

427
00:12:05,230 --> 00:12:07,400
<font size="64">There were flowers somewhere over there.</font>

428
00:12:08,170 --> 00:12:11,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook heads along the path Ye Eun took earlier.)</font>

429
00:12:09,170 --> 00:12:10,940
<font size="64">There are flowers over here.</font>

430
00:12:10,970 --> 00:12:12,170
<font size="64">There are flowers.</font>

431
00:12:14,410 --> 00:12:17,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Arriving at the riverside fork)</font>

432
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:21,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kim Muscles runs to the left.)</font>

433
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:20,010
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

434
00:12:21,210 --> 00:12:23,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Full of flowers)</font>

435
00:12:21,310 --> 00:12:22,350
<font size="64">There are flowers.</font>

436
00:12:24,050 --> 00:12:25,380
<font size="64">People are gathered over there.</font>

437
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:28,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He keeps running along the flowery path.)</font>

438
00:12:29,650 --> 00:12:31,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He found the second guest.)</font>

439
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,360
<font size="64">Who is it?</font>

440
00:12:31,860 --> 00:12:33,090
<font size="64">- He's really tall. - Who's coming?</font>

441
00:12:33,090 --> 00:12:34,130
<font size="64">Who is he?</font>

442
00:12:34,130 --> 00:12:36,590
<font size="64">What? Hang on.</font>

443
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:38,460
<font size="64">A basketball player.</font>

444
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:40,030
<font size="64">Hello.</font>

445
00:12:39,230 --> 00:12:42,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who on earth is this guest built like a utility pole?)</font>

446
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:42,370
<font size="64">The gold medalist!</font>

447
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:45,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(National basketball player Lee Hyun Jung)</font>

448
00:12:43,430 --> 00:12:44,700
<font size="64">Hello!</font>

449
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:47,040
<font size="64">Lee Hyun Jung.</font>

450
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:50,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Men's Basketball MVP of the Asian Games)</font>

451
00:12:47,810 --> 00:12:51,410
<font size="64">Another long-range shot. A three-pointer scored!</font>

452
00:12:50,070 --> 00:12:54,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lee Hyun Jung, the No. 1 successor to the lineage of basketball aces)</font>

453
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:54,780
<font size="64">There's no stopping him. Distance doesn't matter.</font>

454
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:57,650
<font size="64">That wasn't just any random three-pointer.</font>

455
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:58,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His specialty is the long-range shot.)</font>

456
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:00,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Whenever he shoots, it's 3 points.)</font>

457
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,150
<font size="64">Straight-on long-range shot!</font>

458
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:03,320
<font size="64">Three more points added. Plus an extra free throw!</font>

459
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:03,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even his teammate is knocked out.)</font>

460
00:13:03,290 --> 00:13:06,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The one who led Korea to its 1st gold medal in 12 years)</font>

461
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:06,260
<font size="64">Korea's 1st men's basketball gold medal in 12 years.</font>

462
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:07,660
<font size="64">I think this is just the beginning.</font>

463
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:10,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Challenging the NBA by bumping and taking hits)</font>

464
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:10,460
<font size="64">I'm going to challenge myself, collide, and take the hits.</font>

465
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:14,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lee Hyun Jung, the ace of Korean basketball)</font>

466
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:12,430
<font size="64">The golden generation of Korean basketball...</font>

467
00:13:12,430 --> 00:13:14,600
<font size="64">is painting Nagoya in golden light.</font>

468
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:15,970
<font size="64">Nice to meet you.</font>

469
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,970
<font size="64">- You're really tall. - I'm a big fan.</font>

470
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,670
<font size="64">I'm a fan of yours.</font>

471
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:24,070
<font size="64">I've heard a lot about you from Haha.</font>

472
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:28,010
<font size="64">- Nice to meet you. I'm a fan. - How have you been?</font>

473
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Small)</font>

474
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,880
<font size="64">Gosh, seriously...</font>

475
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:32,450
<font size="64">Haha told me so much about you.</font>

476
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:32,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's close to Haha, who is a fan of basketball.)</font>

477
00:13:32,650 --> 00:13:34,250
<font size="64">You actually look even more...</font>

478
00:13:32,950 --> 00:13:37,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Melting)</font>

479
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:36,290
<font size="64">- down-to-earth than I thought. - Thank you.</font>

480
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:40,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What kind of breakfast did Hyun Jung make?)</font>

481
00:13:37,490 --> 00:13:39,690
<font size="64">- For breakfast, - Okay.</font>

482
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:41,360
<font size="64">I made something simple. It's egg rice.</font>

483
00:13:42,330 --> 00:13:45,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hyun Jung's menu: Egg rice)</font>

484
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:45,160
<font size="64">You work out.</font>

485
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:48,200
<font size="64">I care about my health,</font>

486
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,700
<font size="64">so I tend to eat pretty boring meals all the time.</font>

487
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:53,400
<font size="64">I prepared egg rice that I enjoy eating the most.</font>

488
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:55,040
<font size="64">When you cook for yourself,</font>

489
00:13:55,110 --> 00:13:56,910
<font size="64">how many eggs do you usually use?</font>

490
00:13:56,970 --> 00:13:58,610
<font size="64">When I eat alone,</font>

491
00:13:59,010 --> 00:14:00,540
<font size="64">I think I eat about five.</font>

492
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:03,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Folding his body to start cooking)</font>

493
00:14:04,950 --> 00:14:08,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The hint sound was cooking eggs, not meat.)</font>

494
00:14:08,550 --> 00:14:11,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Working hard)</font>

495
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,560
<font size="64">It probably won't make for good footage.</font>

496
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,590
<font size="64">It's way too boring.</font>

497
00:14:15,690 --> 00:14:17,090
<font size="64">Since I live alone and don't like doing dishes,</font>

498
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:18,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Flipping)</font>

499
00:14:17,090 --> 00:14:18,860
<font size="64">I just flip eggs with a spoon.</font>

500
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:21,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A touch that shows the skills of a man living alone)</font>

501
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:22,770
<font size="64">For athletes, eating carbs, protein, and fat is so important.</font>

502
00:14:21,330 --> 00:14:24,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The eggs, as yellow as a gold medal, are done.)</font>

503
00:14:22,770 --> 00:14:24,340
<font size="64">Egg rice has all of that.</font>

504
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:27,300
<font size="64">I don't really like adding seasoning,</font>

505
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:29,510
<font size="64">and seasoning it feels...</font>

506
00:14:29,570 --> 00:14:31,880
<font size="64">a bit less healthy, so I skip it.</font>

507
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:34,040
<font size="64">But since I'm not eating alone today,</font>

508
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:34,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Adding in seasoning this time)</font>

509
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:35,550
<font size="64">I'll compromise a little.</font>

510
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(1 spoonful of soy sauce for 4 servings of rice)</font>

511
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:41,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Egg rice complete with just the essential nutrients)</font>

512
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:41,390
<font size="64">It looks so ugly.</font>

513
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,120
<font size="64">I made something simple. It's egg rice.</font>

514
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

515
00:14:44,590 --> 00:14:45,620
<font size="64">Nice.</font>

516
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:46,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chuckling)</font>

517
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:48,960
<font size="64">- I like it. It's fine. - Do you? It is breakfast.</font>

518
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:49,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A modest menu for all the trouble he went through)</font>

519
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,190
<font size="64">- It looks nice. - Yes.</font>

520
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,200
<font size="64">It's 6g each.</font>

521
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He thought the frying sound was for meat.)</font>

522
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,100
<font size="64">I like it.</font>

523
00:14:54,100 --> 00:14:55,970
<font size="64">- Is this all for me? - No.</font>

524
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:58,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just then)</font>

525
00:14:56,770 --> 00:14:58,570
<font size="64">- Okay! - Team Korea's handsome guy!</font>

526
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,070
<font size="64">- It's Hyun Jung! - Okay!</font>

527
00:15:01,070 --> 00:15:02,340
<font size="64">Team Korea's handsome guy!</font>

528
00:15:02,570 --> 00:15:03,770
<font size="64">Korea basketball's...</font>

529
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:07,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Vomiting sound)</font>

530
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:10,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The kid fan fits under his arm.)</font>

531
00:15:08,980 --> 00:15:09,980
<font size="64">Hyun Jung!</font>

532
00:15:09,980 --> 00:15:12,250
<font size="64">- Is this the actual gold medal? - Yes, the one I won.</font>

533
00:15:12,250 --> 00:15:14,180
<font size="64">Can I... Oh, gosh.</font>

534
00:15:13,780 --> 00:15:16,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They get to actually see the Asian Games gold medal.)</font>

535
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:16,350
<font size="64">- Yes. - Hey, Hyun Jung.</font>

536
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:20,020
<font size="64">- Dong Hoon, look at the gold medal. - Lee Hyun Jung!</font>

537
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:21,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Touching)</font>

538
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:21,290
<font size="64">Gosh...</font>

539
00:15:21,330 --> 00:15:24,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Korea men's 1st basketball gold in 12 years)</font>

540
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:23,160
<font size="64">Look at the gold medal.</font>

541
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:25,660
<font size="64">Can I try this on?</font>

542
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:27,330
<font size="64">- Let me do the honors. - Oh, gosh.</font>

543
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:28,770
<font size="64">My goodness.</font>

544
00:15:28,770 --> 00:15:30,330
<font size="64">You can't walk off with this around...</font>

545
00:15:29,070 --> 00:15:31,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Worried about the egg rice)</font>

546
00:15:30,330 --> 00:15:31,740
<font size="64">I wouldn't do that.</font>

547
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:36,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A basketball fan's dream come true)</font>

548
00:15:35,110 --> 00:15:36,370
<font size="64">I'm so grateful for this.</font>

549
00:15:37,710 --> 00:15:39,080
<font size="64">- Oh, hello. - Hi.</font>

550
00:15:39,310 --> 00:15:41,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Hyo joins them.)</font>

551
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,580
<font size="64">Hello.</font>

552
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:44,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Hyun Jung is complete with all 3 members.)</font>

553
00:15:42,950 --> 00:15:43,980
<font size="64">You want in?</font>

554
00:15:44,010 --> 00:15:45,220
<font size="64">Two, three.</font>

555
00:15:44,650 --> 00:15:47,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A relaxing photoshoot)</font>

556
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,520
<font size="64">- Okay. - This is great.</font>

557
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:48,720
<font size="64">A gold medal...</font>

558
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:50,390
<font size="64">You kept your word.</font>

559
00:15:50,390 --> 00:15:51,920
<font size="64">Me too? The gold medal...</font>

560
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,860
<font size="64">I wanted to show off.</font>

561
00:15:55,860 --> 00:15:58,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Let's have egg rice!)</font>

562
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:02,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fascinated)</font>

563
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,170
<font size="64">I watched Running Man since I was a kid.</font>

564
00:16:01,170 --> 00:16:03,770
<font size="64">- You have that feel. - You were a Running Man Kid?</font>

565
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:04,800
<font size="64">- Totally. - Really?</font>

566
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,900
<font size="64">- We did this for 16 years. - I watched as a child.</font>

567
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:09,140
<font size="64">Even now, I watch it before bed when I feel lonely abroad.</font>

568
00:16:09,140 --> 00:16:11,740
<font size="64">- We're your meal buddy. - This feels like a dream.</font>

569
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:12,910
<font size="64">Oh, gosh.</font>

570
00:16:13,140 --> 00:16:15,110
<font size="64">- I'm grateful for guys like this. - Seriously.</font>

571
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:16,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Somewhat proud)</font>

572
00:16:15,110 --> 00:16:16,750
<font size="64">You grew up so well.</font>

573
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:18,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dazed)</font>

574
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:17,880
<font size="64">Not at all.</font>

575
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:19,350
<font size="64">- This is great. - Thank you so much.</font>

576
00:16:19,350 --> 00:16:20,920
<font size="64">There's no way we'd betray you.</font>

577
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,520
<font size="64">- What? - Never.</font>

578
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:25,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Proving that he is a fan)</font>

579
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:24,760
<font size="64">- I know the truth. - No, not today. Honestly.</font>

580
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:26,460
<font size="64">- I know. - Not me.</font>

581
00:16:26,020 --> 00:16:29,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Hyun Jung's crew promises to stay put...)</font>

582
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:27,590
<font size="64">- You know me. - I do.</font>

583
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:29,130
<font size="64">Around these two, I can be...</font>

584
00:16:29,890 --> 00:16:31,060
<font size="64">Oh, it's Hyun Jung?</font>

585
00:16:31,900 --> 00:16:34,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok arrives at Hyun Jung's place, which is already full.)</font>

586
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,570
<font size="64">He won gold at the Asian Games.</font>

587
00:16:34,570 --> 00:16:36,770
<font size="64">- What's going on here? - The pride of Korean basketball.</font>

588
00:16:36,770 --> 00:16:38,040
<font size="64">- We meet again. - Yes.</font>

589
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:40,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They greet each other first.)</font>

590
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,310
<font size="64">Oh, it's over.</font>

591
00:16:42,110 --> 00:16:45,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even Ssaebssaeb arrives at the finished team.)</font>

592
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:44,610
<font size="64">- Someone else is here. - Oh, dear.</font>

593
00:16:44,610 --> 00:16:45,980
<font size="64">- Run. - We're a team.</font>

594
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:47,140
<font size="64">- Se Chan's here too. - Shoot.</font>

595
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:49,610
<font size="64">- Get going. You're late. - We can't move.</font>

596
00:16:49,010 --> 00:16:52,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hurriedly searching for the other team)</font>

597
00:16:50,850 --> 00:16:51,980
<font size="64">Hey, Ssabssab.</font>

598
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:56,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(There is only room for one more person.)</font>

599
00:16:53,450 --> 00:16:56,250
<font size="64">It's three people per menu, right?</font>

600
00:16:57,020 --> 00:17:01,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 1 person who reaches Min Jong first gets to eat.)</font>

601
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,960
<font size="64">- The openings... - That team is full.</font>

602
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:03,060
<font size="64">I think there's one opening left.</font>

603
00:17:01,690 --> 00:17:03,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The other team)</font>

604
00:17:04,430 --> 00:17:06,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok is in the lead.)</font>

605
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:08,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just then)</font>

606
00:17:08,930 --> 00:17:11,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ssaebssaeb changes direction.)</font>

607
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:15,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They chose different routes.)</font>

608
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:19,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who will reach Min Jong first?)</font>

609
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,550
<font size="64">The other team seemed to be grilling meat.</font>

610
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:22,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At that moment at Min Jong's place...)</font>

611
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:23,280
<font size="64">- No, they fried eggs. - They...</font>

612
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:25,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The sound hint)</font>

613
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:25,480
<font size="64">No, I think they were cooking meat.</font>

614
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,650
<font size="64">There's still time, and they're over there.</font>

615
00:17:28,150 --> 00:17:30,120
<font size="64">- I'll go and... Okay? - Okay.</font>

616
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:31,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam leaves the team!)</font>

617
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:33,090
<font size="64">- I don't think he'll make it back. - I doubt it.</font>

618
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,330
<font size="64">- I think he'll lose his spot. - Yes.</font>

619
00:17:35,590 --> 00:17:38,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He leaves in search of meat, not knowing the situation.)</font>

620
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:39,960
<font size="64">I see Jae Seok.</font>

621
00:17:40,260 --> 00:17:41,770
<font size="64">I see Jae Seok.</font>

622
00:17:40,930 --> 00:17:44,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok's dashing toward Min Jong.)</font>

623
00:17:42,030 --> 00:17:43,230
<font size="64">What's the other team eating?</font>

624
00:17:43,830 --> 00:17:45,600
<font size="64">- Is he over there? - He is, but...</font>

625
00:17:44,370 --> 00:17:45,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stopping)</font>

626
00:17:45,600 --> 00:17:47,400
<font size="64">If he's coming this way, it's a bad sign.</font>

627
00:17:47,470 --> 00:17:50,270
<font size="64">Oh, no. Se Chan's over there!</font>

628
00:17:50,370 --> 00:17:52,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan shows up)</font>

629
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,140
<font size="64">It's Se Chan!</font>

630
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:55,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Three people running toward Min Jong)</font>

631
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:53,910
<font size="64">Three people running...</font>

632
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:57,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only 2 spots remain.)</font>

633
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:59,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(One will be left teamless.)</font>

634
00:18:00,180 --> 00:18:02,490
<font size="64">Who will be first? Hurry. Run.</font>

635
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:02,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam arrives.)</font>

636
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:07,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who will join the team last?)</font>

637
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:09,190
<font size="64">I took the other way...</font>

638
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:12,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok was faster!)</font>

639
00:18:09,930 --> 00:18:11,030
<font size="64">- Darn it! - Okay.</font>

640
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:12,500
<font size="64">It was close.</font>

641
00:18:12,060 --> 00:18:15,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok joins Min Jong's team with no time to spare.)</font>

642
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:13,700
<font size="64">- If I'd gone over there... - Gosh, Seok Sam.</font>

643
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:14,970
<font size="64">It was really close.</font>

644
00:18:14,970 --> 00:18:16,470
<font size="64">- Min Jong. - Long time no see.</font>

645
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:17,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ssaebssaeb can't have breakfast.)</font>

646
00:18:16,470 --> 00:18:17,870
<font size="64">- Congratulations on the gold. - Thanks.</font>

647
00:18:17,870 --> 00:18:20,040
<font size="64">- Min Jong. It's been a while. - It has been, yes.</font>

648
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:22,040
<font size="64">I wore dress shoes because of Haha.</font>

649
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:24,580
<font size="64">- I couldn't run as fast. - I wondered about that.</font>

650
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,010
<font size="64">Ssaebssaeb doesn't get to eat.</font>

651
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:29,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Final results)</font>

652
00:18:26,010 --> 00:18:28,310
<font size="64">I'll lodge a complaint with Haha.</font>

653
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,350
<font size="64">Seriously...</font>

654
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:31,580
<font size="64">Aren't we at Nodeulseom?</font>

655
00:18:31,620 --> 00:18:32,620
<font size="64">- It is. - It's Nodeulseom,</font>

656
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:33,750
<font size="64">- but it changed. - It's totally different.</font>

657
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:35,520
<font size="64">They revamped this side here.</font>

658
00:18:36,250 --> 00:18:39,320
<font size="64">It's way nicer and more romantic.</font>

659
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:40,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Nodeulseom got a new look in September.)</font>

660
00:18:43,490 --> 00:18:48,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A romantic view of the river)</font>

661
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:47,130
<font size="64">Look over there. They're taking photos like crazy.</font>

662
00:18:47,130 --> 00:18:49,200
<font size="64">It's fall now too.</font>

663
00:18:48,330 --> 00:18:53,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They can feel the beauty of fall in Seoul by taking a walk.)</font>

664
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:51,340
<font size="64">- Yes. - The color of the sky...</font>

665
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:53,600
<font size="64">- It's really... - I'll come back. I swear.</font>

666
00:18:53,970 --> 00:18:55,740
<font size="64">I need to. It's so nice.</font>

667
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:56,940
<font size="64">It's nicely done.</font>

668
00:18:55,810 --> 00:18:58,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Nature rules during the day,)</font>

669
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:02,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(and art takes over at night.)</font>

670
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:03,680
<font size="64">I saw a cafe earlier. It's nice here.</font>

671
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:05,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A place where every step leads to stunning scenery)</font>

672
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:05,150
<font size="64">All you need is a picnic mat.</font>

673
00:19:05,450 --> 00:19:07,620
<font size="64">I hear lots of people come here.</font>

674
00:19:07,750 --> 00:19:09,520
<font size="64">Lots of people come here to jog in the morning.</font>

675
00:19:08,990 --> 00:19:13,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While they are captivated by the charms of Nodeulseom...)</font>

676
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:11,890
<font size="64">Yes. I saw, and it's pretty romantic.</font>

677
00:19:11,890 --> 00:19:13,220
<font size="64">- It's crazy. - Right?</font>

678
00:19:13,490 --> 00:19:15,590
<font size="64">- You're really tall. - You're sturdy yourself.</font>

679
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:16,730
<font size="64">- Were you born in 2000? - Yes.</font>

680
00:19:16,730 --> 00:19:18,200
<font size="64">- Me too. - Really? We're the same age.</font>

681
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:21,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The national athletes have found a friend.)</font>

682
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,360
<font size="64">- A friend. - You knew, right?</font>

683
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:22,170
<font size="64">- Yes, I knew as well. - Great.</font>

684
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:25,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Shy)</font>

685
00:19:22,170 --> 00:19:23,530
<font size="64">I saw you a lot on YouTube.</font>

686
00:19:23,530 --> 00:19:25,270
<font size="64">Did you? Thanks.</font>

687
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:26,570
<font size="64">Your attempt to join the NBA.</font>

688
00:19:26,570 --> 00:19:28,110
<font size="64">Yes. I saw your clips too.</font>

689
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:29,440
<font size="64">- Really? - I'm a fan.</font>

690
00:19:30,010 --> 00:19:32,080
<font size="64">- Can we take a selfie later? - Goodness.</font>

691
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:33,810
<font size="64">- I wanted to ask you. - Me first.</font>

692
00:19:33,810 --> 00:19:35,450
<font size="64">- Hyun Jung. - Hyun Jung.</font>

693
00:19:34,910 --> 00:19:37,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They sit on the picnic mat.)</font>

694
00:19:35,450 --> 00:19:37,510
<font size="64">- Yes? - Hyun Jung. Come here.</font>

695
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:38,650
<font size="64">Hey, your feet...</font>

696
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:41,180
<font size="64">- His feet... - How long are your feet?</font>

697
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:43,320
<font size="64">- They're 32cm long. - That's so cool.</font>

698
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:45,360
<font size="64">- How manly. It's 32cm. - What a man.</font>

699
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:45,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Marveling)</font>

700
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:48,360
<font size="64">- Se Chan got left out? - Yes.</font>

701
00:19:48,860 --> 00:19:50,230
<font size="64">Don't eat, Se Chan.</font>

702
00:19:50,690 --> 00:19:52,600
<font size="64">Or catch a fish to eat.</font>

703
00:19:53,030 --> 00:19:54,130
<font size="64">Give me a fishing rod, at least.</font>

704
00:19:54,300 --> 00:19:56,370
<font size="64">- What's up? - Se Chan failed the mission,</font>

705
00:19:56,370 --> 00:19:58,200
<font size="64">so we'll remove your bowls and cutlery.</font>

706
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:00,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Snatch)</font>

707
00:20:00,470 --> 00:20:01,640
<font size="64">What does he get, then?</font>

708
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:02,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Snatch)</font>

709
00:20:02,270 --> 00:20:04,940
<font size="64">Why rush? You can take your time.</font>

710
00:20:02,710 --> 00:20:03,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Upset)</font>

711
00:20:03,810 --> 00:20:05,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hurrying)</font>

712
00:20:06,310 --> 00:20:09,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fascinated)</font>

713
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:09,610
<font size="64">They really take stuff away?</font>

714
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:13,880
<font size="64">Hyun Jung and the Korean men's basketball team...</font>

715
00:20:14,050 --> 00:20:16,050
<font size="64">- won the gold medal. - Yes, after 12 years.</font>

716
00:20:14,180 --> 00:20:15,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lee Hyun Jung leads the men's basketball team...)</font>

717
00:20:15,890 --> 00:20:17,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(to its first Asian Games gold medal in 12 years.)</font>

718
00:20:16,050 --> 00:20:18,560
<font size="64">- That's right. - It wasn't an easy feat.</font>

719
00:20:18,560 --> 00:20:20,060
<font size="64">It really is something.</font>

720
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:21,760
<font size="64">The last gold was in Busan.</font>

721
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:24,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It is the first time since the Incheon Asian Games in 2014.)</font>

722
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:24,730
<font size="64">- That last basketball gold medal. - You're right.</font>

723
00:20:24,730 --> 00:20:27,630
<font size="64">It was a dramatic win that time too.</font>

724
00:20:27,630 --> 00:20:28,930
<font size="64">It was Busan and Incheon.</font>

725
00:20:28,030 --> 00:20:31,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's the ace player who won Korea a gold medal after 12 years.)</font>

726
00:20:28,930 --> 00:20:30,670
<font size="64">- Busan and Incheon. Right. - Yes.</font>

727
00:20:30,670 --> 00:20:32,270
<font size="64">It's impressive, really.</font>

728
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:34,640
<font size="64">Hyun Jung said he's a Running Man Kid.</font>

729
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:36,840
<font size="64">- Yes, that's true. - Brace yourselves.</font>

730
00:20:34,740 --> 00:20:37,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The fan of Running Man is excited.)</font>

731
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:39,510
<font size="64">- What bothers me is that Haha... - How about we...</font>

732
00:20:39,610 --> 00:20:43,210
<font size="64">When Hyun Jung was competing in the Japanese pro league...</font>

733
00:20:43,310 --> 00:20:45,220
<font size="64">- He did it again? - To film a YouTube video,</font>

734
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:46,420
<font size="64">- Haha went to Japan. - I did.</font>

735
00:20:45,250 --> 00:20:48,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He went all the way to Japan, sensing the star potential.)</font>

736
00:20:46,420 --> 00:20:48,250
<font size="64">- You went? - Yes.</font>

737
00:20:48,420 --> 00:20:50,420
<font size="64">My goodness. Stop harassing people!</font>

738
00:20:50,420 --> 00:20:51,760
<font size="64">Why are you such a nuisance?</font>

739
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:54,020
<font size="64">Hey! That's how I show my support, you punk!</font>

740
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:53,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Snapping)</font>

741
00:20:55,430 --> 00:20:57,960
<font size="64">You caused a nuisance in Busan and then in Japan.</font>

742
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,460
<font size="64">What did I do in Busan?</font>

743
00:20:58,100 --> 00:21:01,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The YouTube Man pokes around in search of a star.)</font>

744
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:00,700
<font size="64">And in Hongdae too.</font>

745
00:21:00,830 --> 00:21:02,100
<font size="64">Don't mention that!</font>

746
00:21:02,270 --> 00:21:03,500
<font size="64">Is anything I do a nuisance?</font>

747
00:21:02,330 --> 00:21:04,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Taking off his hat)</font>

748
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:05,300
<font size="64">- Ma'am! Wear your cap! - Come on.</font>

749
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:07,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's busy following on with trends.)</font>

750
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:07,300
<font size="64">- Lady. - Who?</font>

751
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:09,540
<font size="64">- Min Jong too. - Yes.</font>

752
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:12,210
<font size="64">- He won bronze at the Asian Games. - Yes!</font>

753
00:21:11,210 --> 00:21:14,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Judo bronze medalist)</font>

754
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:14,480
<font size="64">- Kim Min Jong! - Well done!</font>

755
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:17,150
<font size="64">The National Sports Festival ended two days ago, and he won gold.</font>

756
00:21:15,010 --> 00:21:18,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A gold at the 107th National Sports Festival!)</font>

757
00:21:19,320 --> 00:21:22,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He showed his powerful tiger moves after overcoming an injury.)</font>

758
00:21:23,020 --> 00:21:25,160
<font size="64">- He got back yesterday. - That's right.</font>

759
00:21:23,050 --> 00:21:26,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Wrapping up the season with gold at the National Sports Festival.)</font>

760
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,820
<font size="64">Some events are still ongoing.</font>

761
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The face of Korean Judo)</font>

762
00:21:27,260 --> 00:21:28,360
<font size="64">I'm proud of you!</font>

763
00:21:28,630 --> 00:21:31,190
<font size="64">Min Jong, can you show us what you prepared?</font>

764
00:21:31,190 --> 00:21:33,230
<font size="64">- Yes, sure. - You'll be shocked.</font>

765
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:37,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Half broth, half meat, Min Jong's pork and kimchi stew)</font>

766
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:35,700
<font size="64">My gosh!</font>

767
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:41,940
<font size="64">He sliced the pork shoulder into thick chunks.</font>

768
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:42,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A rich broth simmered by the butcher's second son)</font>

769
00:21:43,740 --> 00:21:45,310
<font size="64">My gosh!</font>

770
00:21:45,780 --> 00:21:47,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sounds impressed)</font>

771
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:49,450
<font size="64">Min Jong's father provided the meat.</font>

772
00:21:49,450 --> 00:21:50,580
<font size="64">- Really? - The pork.</font>

773
00:21:50,510 --> 00:21:53,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The pork neck he got from his father is the key ingredient.)</font>

774
00:21:50,580 --> 00:21:52,020
<font size="64">- There's meat in there? - Yes.</font>

775
00:21:52,020 --> 00:21:53,420
<font size="64">- Pork. - Pork shoulder.</font>

776
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:55,590
<font size="64">- It smells delicious. - Isn't that against the rules?</font>

777
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Amazing)</font>

778
00:21:55,590 --> 00:21:57,790
<font size="64">Gukbap, you must want some of this.</font>

779
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,090
<font size="64">He loves something soupy for breakfast.</font>

780
00:22:00,090 --> 00:22:01,530
<font size="64">I can't handle the smell!</font>

781
00:22:01,530 --> 00:22:02,930
<font size="64">- Gosh. - It's okay.</font>

782
00:22:02,530 --> 00:22:04,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Reading the room)</font>

783
00:22:02,930 --> 00:22:04,360
<font size="64">It smells insane.</font>

784
00:22:04,860 --> 00:22:06,430
<font size="64">I'll put this over here.</font>

785
00:22:06,430 --> 00:22:07,830
<font size="64">- Soy sauce egg rice is good too. - I will...</font>

786
00:22:07,830 --> 00:22:09,530
<font size="64">- join this team. - In the morning...</font>

787
00:22:09,530 --> 00:22:11,600
<font size="64">- I will join this team. - In the morning...</font>

788
00:22:12,540 --> 00:22:14,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Moving close to Min Jong)</font>

789
00:22:13,970 --> 00:22:15,310
<font size="64">- What's going on there? - Join us.</font>

