<font size="64">- You know that? - I'll steal it.</font>

2153
00:56:27,720 --> 00:56:31,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He takes Seok Sam's seat, Running Man's landmark.)</font>

2154
00:56:29,860 --> 00:56:32,230
<font size="64">- Yes, good. - You have extra-long legs.</font>

2155
00:56:32,230 --> 00:56:33,700
<font size="64">- You love Running Man. - Yes.</font>

2156
00:56:32,590 --> 00:56:35,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He proves he grew up watching Running Man.)</font>

2157
00:56:33,700 --> 00:56:35,060
<font size="64">- I love it. - You know everything.</font>

2158
00:56:35,060 --> 00:56:38,070
<font size="64">Running Man is all I watch. I don't watch anything else.</font>

2159
00:56:38,070 --> 00:56:39,070
<font size="64">He's here.</font>

2160
00:56:39,530 --> 00:56:41,840
<font size="64">You'll feel uncomfortable in that seat.</font>

2161
00:56:39,600 --> 00:56:42,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's my seat.)</font>

2162
00:56:42,240 --> 00:56:45,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam responds in his own way.)</font>

2163
00:56:42,340 --> 00:56:44,370
<font size="64">You don't think so? It's better back here.</font>

2164
00:56:45,370 --> 00:56:47,110
<font size="64">- It's so comfortable. - You're tall.</font>

2165
00:56:47,510 --> 00:56:50,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He sits in the back with a fake smile.)</font>

2166
00:56:48,040 --> 00:56:49,610
<font size="64">Nice one, Hyun Jung.</font>

2167
00:56:49,610 --> 00:56:51,350
<font size="64">Sit wherever you want, Hyun Jung.</font>

2168
00:56:50,880 --> 00:56:52,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Happy)</font>

2169
00:56:51,350 --> 00:56:53,050
<font size="64">- Stay there. - Sit there and relax.</font>

2170
00:56:52,710 --> 00:56:56,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hyun Jung tried sitting there for a moment before leaving.)</font>

2171
00:56:53,050 --> 00:56:54,720
<font size="64">- Sit down. - Sit there.</font>

2172
00:56:54,720 --> 00:56:56,850
<font size="64">- Sit back there. - It's fine. Sit sideways.</font>

2173
00:56:56,850 --> 00:56:58,450
<font size="64">That space is too small. Go back.</font>

2174
00:56:58,090 --> 00:57:01,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Min Jong, the next guest, takes a seat.)</font>

2175
00:56:58,450 --> 00:56:59,690
<font size="64">- Sit here. - Sit here.</font>

2176
00:56:59,690 --> 00:57:01,720
<font size="64">- It's too narrow here. - It's fine. It's fun.</font>

2177
00:57:01,720 --> 00:57:04,690
<font size="64">- You'll feel cramped. - You should sit there today.</font>

2178
00:57:01,860 --> 00:57:05,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Quietly gives up his seat to the fighter)</font>

2179
00:57:05,460 --> 00:57:06,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Giggling)</font>

2180
00:57:07,330 --> 00:57:10,470
<font size="64">Hyun Jung, I think you enjoyed playing basketball for once.</font>

2181
00:57:10,470 --> 00:57:12,730
<font size="64">I lost for the first time in a long time too.</font>

2182
00:57:14,000 --> 00:57:16,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dumbfounded)</font>

2183
00:57:14,140 --> 00:57:15,700
<font size="64">I won gold at the Asian Games and lost here.</font>

2184
00:57:15,700 --> 00:57:17,940
<font size="64">- "The first time in a long time." - That's really funny.</font>

2185
00:57:17,610 --> 00:57:19,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The main reason they lost)</font>

2186
00:57:18,070 --> 00:57:19,410
<font size="64">Sorry about that.</font>

2187
00:57:19,510 --> 00:57:21,140
<font size="64">Life never lets you have it all.</font>

2188
00:57:21,140 --> 00:57:22,940
<font size="64">- Win in the NBA. - Okay.</font>

2189
00:57:21,510 --> 00:57:24,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(As they give him some much-needed tough love,)</font>

2190
00:57:23,310 --> 00:57:24,750
<font size="64">This is great.</font>

2191
00:57:24,750 --> 00:57:26,150
<font size="64">- What's this? - I smell something nice.</font>

2192
00:57:25,050 --> 00:57:28,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they arrive at a restaurant filled with delicious smells.)</font>

2193
00:57:26,150 --> 00:57:29,050
<font size="64">- I smell something tasty. - What's this?</font>

2194
00:57:29,050 --> 00:57:31,450
<font size="64">- I wonder. - What is it this time?</font>

2195
00:57:31,450 --> 00:57:34,620
<font size="64">I said we'd follow the two athletes' food routine.</font>

2196
00:57:33,490 --> 00:57:36,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They've followed the two athletes' usual dining routine to this place.)</font>

2197
00:57:34,620 --> 00:57:37,260
<font size="64">- Yes. - This place sells...</font>

2198
00:57:37,260 --> 00:57:39,360
<font size="64">the energy-boosting food made with Min Jong's favorite ingredient.</font>

2199
00:57:39,490 --> 00:57:43,500
<font size="64">We also prepared what Hyun Jung often eats that's actually served...</font>

2200
00:57:43,500 --> 00:57:44,770
<font size="64">to NBA athletes.</font>

2201
00:57:44,770 --> 00:57:46,170
<font size="64">- It's high in protein. - NBA athletes?</font>

2202
00:57:46,170 --> 00:57:47,700
<font size="64">Don't they like steak?</font>

2203
00:57:47,700 --> 00:57:48,740
<font size="64">- That's crazy. - Right.</font>

2204
00:57:48,400 --> 00:57:49,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hoping for a protein-rich meal)</font>

2205
00:57:48,740 --> 00:57:52,440
<font size="64">We'll reveal the dishes after you choose what to eat.</font>

2206
00:57:52,570 --> 00:57:55,880
<font size="64">The next mission will decide which order you get to choose.</font>

2207
00:57:55,880 --> 00:57:57,580
<font size="64">- We must pick. - Okay.</font>

2208
00:57:57,580 --> 00:58:00,950
<font size="64">We allow a maximum of five people per dish.</font>

2209
00:58:00,950 --> 00:58:02,050
<font size="64">Just five.</font>

2210
00:58:02,050 --> 00:58:04,590
<font size="64">The mission is called I'll Get It.</font>

2211
00:58:04,590 --> 00:58:07,760
<font size="64">Members of an opposing team will hold a horizontal elastic band.</font>

2212
00:58:07,760 --> 00:58:11,060
<font size="64">One of you has to push through the elastic band and get an item.</font>

2213
00:58:11,660 --> 00:58:15,330
<font size="64">You each take a turn, and you get seven seconds each.</font>

2214
00:58:15,430 --> 00:58:17,670
<font size="64">You'll split into three teams.</font>

2215
00:58:17,800 --> 00:58:20,340
<font size="64">Jong Kook, Min Jong, and Hyun Jung...</font>

2216
00:58:20,340 --> 00:58:22,370
<font size="64">will be the three team leaders.</font>

2217
00:58:22,370 --> 00:58:25,370
<font size="64">Try to keep things balanced as you select your teammates.</font>

2218
00:58:25,370 --> 00:58:27,140
<font size="64">We don't stand a chance against Min Jong.</font>

2219
00:58:25,470 --> 00:58:28,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Worried)</font>

2220
00:58:27,140 --> 00:58:28,340
<font size="64">- No. - No.</font>

2221
00:58:28,340 --> 00:58:31,510
<font size="64">Min Jong... He's too strong.</font>

2222
00:58:28,610 --> 00:58:31,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're intimidated by his size.)</font>

2223
00:58:31,510 --> 00:58:33,620
<font size="64">- Go on. - Rock-paper-scissors.</font>

2224
00:58:33,310 --> 00:58:35,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The team leaders played rock-paper-scissors.)</font>

2225
00:58:33,620 --> 00:58:34,650
<font size="64">- Okay. - Seok Jin.</font>

2226
00:58:34,650 --> 00:58:36,750
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - It's pretty balanced.</font>

2227
00:58:35,350 --> 00:58:39,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Jong Kook, Team Hyun Joong, Team Min Jong)</font>

2228
00:58:36,750 --> 00:58:37,850
<font size="64">- Yes. - Nice one.</font>

2229
00:58:37,850 --> 00:58:39,720
<font size="64">- It's fine. - The athletes...</font>

2230
00:58:40,390 --> 00:58:41,420
<font size="64">- Looking good. - Okay.</font>

2231
00:58:41,090 --> 00:58:42,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Grabbing hard)</font>

2232
00:58:41,420 --> 00:58:42,660
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

2233
00:58:42,960 --> 00:58:45,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A powerful human barricade)</font>

2234
00:58:44,560 --> 00:58:46,760
<font size="64">- You're really something. - I'm fine.</font>

2235
00:58:45,730 --> 00:58:47,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Min Jong is his team's only hope.)</font>

2236
00:58:48,430 --> 00:58:49,730
<font size="64">You're insane.</font>

2237
00:58:49,030 --> 00:58:50,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The items are revealed)</font>

2238
00:58:51,130 --> 00:58:52,770
<font size="64">What's this? What are all those?</font>

2239
00:58:52,770 --> 00:58:53,770
<font size="64">- What's that? - What's that?</font>

2240
00:58:54,070 --> 00:58:55,340
<font size="64">- Oh... - What's this?</font>

2241
00:58:55,100 --> 00:58:58,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Writer)</font>

2242
00:58:55,340 --> 00:58:56,500
<font size="64">Heavy things are worth more points.</font>

2243
00:58:56,500 --> 00:58:58,110
<font size="64">Heavy things are worth more points?</font>

2244
00:58:58,110 --> 00:59:00,240
<font size="64">- What is this? - What's that thing?</font>

2245
00:58:58,970 --> 00:59:01,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Items are assigned different point values from 1 to 9.)</font>

2246
00:59:00,240 --> 00:59:02,540
<font size="64">The number on each item is the points they're worth.</font>

2247
00:59:01,710 --> 00:59:02,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A 1-point avocado, the lowest-scoring item)</font>

2248
00:59:02,780 --> 00:59:04,750
<font size="64">- The points. - You don't take them home.</font>

2249
00:59:02,980 --> 00:59:04,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Light, low-scoring objects)</font>

2250
00:59:04,680 --> 00:59:05,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A 20kg sandbag worth the maximum 9 points)</font>

2251
00:59:04,750 --> 00:59:07,620
<font size="64">- This is heavy. - It won't be easy.</font>

2252
00:59:05,780 --> 00:59:07,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Heavier, high-scoring items)</font>

2253
00:59:07,620 --> 00:59:09,520
<font size="64">- You have seven seconds. - You can't lift this.</font>

2254
00:59:09,720 --> 00:59:11,190
<font size="64">- It's that heavy? - It's pretty heavy.</font>

2255
00:59:10,920 --> 00:59:13,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even with both hands, the 20kg sandbag is heavy to lift.)</font>

2256
00:59:11,520 --> 00:59:13,890
<font size="64">- Are they dumbbells? - It's pretty heavy.</font>

2257
00:59:13,890 --> 00:59:15,360
<font size="64">This one has a handle.</font>

2258
00:59:13,960 --> 00:59:15,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's heavy?)</font>

2259
00:59:15,360 --> 00:59:17,230
<font size="64">- I can handle 5 points. - That's why it's 9 points.</font>

2260
00:59:17,160 --> 00:59:19,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Light)</font>

2261
00:59:17,490 --> 00:59:18,960
<font size="64">- It's hefty. - It's light to you?</font>

2262
00:59:19,960 --> 00:59:21,560
<font size="64">It's not... It's light.</font>

2263
00:59:20,230 --> 00:59:22,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's light for Min Jong.)</font>

2264
00:59:21,860 --> 00:59:22,900
<font size="64">- That's fine. - Okay.</font>

2265
00:59:22,900 --> 00:59:24,630
<font size="64">Team Hyun Jung will attack first.</font>

2266
00:59:23,200 --> 00:59:25,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Hyun Jung goes first.)</font>

2267
00:59:24,630 --> 00:59:26,570
<font size="64">- It's not easy. - One from the other two teams...</font>

2268
00:59:26,370 --> 00:59:28,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The opposing team defends by holding the resistance band.)</font>

2269
00:59:26,570 --> 00:59:28,540
<font size="64">must come up to hold the elastic band.</font>

2270
00:59:28,670 --> 00:59:30,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Min Jong on the left side, Jong Kook on the right side)</font>

2271
00:59:29,040 --> 00:59:30,540
<font size="64">- This will do. - It's no joke.</font>

2272
00:59:30,540 --> 00:59:32,240
<font size="64">- You hold it like this? - Why is it you two?</font>

2273
00:59:30,940 --> 00:59:32,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Flustered)</font>

2274
00:59:32,240 --> 00:59:33,910
<font size="64">- Like this? - We must push through.</font>

2275
00:59:32,910 --> 00:59:35,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're the strongest members from both teams.)</font>

2276
00:59:33,910 --> 00:59:35,740
<font size="64">How do we get through? Hang on.</font>

2277
00:59:35,440 --> 00:59:38,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The band is highly elastic.)</font>

2278
00:59:35,780 --> 00:59:37,450
<font size="64">This is serious business.</font>

2279
00:59:38,280 --> 00:59:40,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will he be able to get through it and grab an item?)</font>

2280
00:59:38,450 --> 00:59:40,750
<font size="64">- Okay! - Let me test it.</font>

2281
00:59:40,850 --> 00:59:42,120
<font size="64">Let's do this.</font>

2282
00:59:41,850 --> 00:59:44,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Extending)</font>

2283
00:59:42,120 --> 00:59:44,520
<font size="64">- He has long arms. - We can't get any closer.</font>

2284
00:59:44,520 --> 00:59:46,890
<font size="64">- Wait. - Wait! His arms are too long.</font>

2285
00:59:46,890 --> 00:59:49,160
<font size="64">Is this allowed? Can I do this...</font>

2286
00:59:49,320 --> 00:59:51,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He plans to reach and toss.)</font>

2287
00:59:50,960 --> 00:59:53,060
<font size="64">- Can I throw it? - You can.</font>

2288
00:59:51,090 --> 00:59:53,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(With his long arms, he can reach it just by stretching.)</font>

2289
00:59:53,060 --> 00:59:55,630
<font size="64">- Seven seconds. - Anything behind the line counts.</font>

2290
00:59:53,660 --> 00:59:55,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only the items behind the line count.)</font>

2291
00:59:55,630 --> 00:59:57,900
<font size="64">Behind the line? We can throw things, then.</font>

2292
00:59:58,170 --> 00:59:59,870
<font size="64">You have seven seconds.</font>

2293
00:59:58,300 --> 01:00:00,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They have 7 seconds.)</font>

2294
00:59:59,870 --> 01:00:01,740
<font size="64">- Okay. - Look at Min Jong's arm.</font>

2295
01:00:02,570 --> 01:00:03,570
<font size="64">- His reach... - It's impossible.</font>

2296
01:00:03,570 --> 01:00:04,670
<font size="64">Ready.</font>

2297
01:00:03,910 --> 01:00:06,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A showdown between powerhouses)</font>

2298
01:00:05,270 --> 01:00:06,670
<font size="64">- Get set. - How do you get through?</font>

2299
01:00:07,080 --> 01:00:08,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stretching)</font>

2300
01:00:08,640 --> 01:00:09,810
<font size="64">Oh, nice one.</font>

2301
01:00:10,410 --> 01:00:12,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He starts grabbing with his long arms.)</font>

2302
01:00:12,110 --> 01:00:13,410
<font size="64">Oh, nice one.</font>

2303
01:00:12,880 --> 01:00:14,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Staggering)</font>

2304
01:00:13,410 --> 01:00:14,450
<font size="64">Oh, gosh.</font>

2305
01:00:15,420 --> 01:00:17,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He gets the sandbag worth the maximum 9 points.)</font>

2306
01:00:15,550 --> 01:00:17,650
<font size="64">Oh, nice one. Nicely done.</font>

2307
01:00:17,990 --> 01:00:20,860
<font size="64">He's too long. His limbs are too long.</font>

2308
01:00:18,920 --> 01:00:21,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kim Muscles struggles helplessly as he's dragged away.)</font>

2309
01:00:21,160 --> 01:00:22,960
<font size="64">He's too long. His limbs are too long.</font>

2310
01:00:22,790 --> 01:00:23,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Falling and scattering)</font>

2311
01:00:24,330 --> 01:00:26,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Holding tight)</font>

2312
01:00:25,730 --> 01:00:26,730
<font size="64">No way.</font>

2313
01:00:26,630 --> 01:00:29,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Min Jong drags Hyun Jung back.)</font>

2314
01:00:26,830 --> 01:00:28,330
<font size="64">- Nice. - He's strong.</font>

2315
01:00:28,330 --> 01:00:29,760
<font size="64">- He's strong. - Nice.</font>

2316
01:00:29,330 --> 01:00:31,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Min Jong's defense ends the game.)</font>

2317
01:00:30,770 --> 01:00:32,600
<font size="64">- He's too long. - It's over?</font>

2318
01:00:32,600 --> 01:00:33,770
<font size="64">How did this happen?</font>

2319
01:00:33,770 --> 01:00:35,240
<font size="64">- This doesn't count. - That's out.</font>

2320
01:00:34,200 --> 01:00:36,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His glove got worn out from grabbing Hyun Jung.)</font>

2321
01:00:35,240 --> 01:00:36,440
<font size="64">- This is in. - Yes.</font>

2322
01:00:36,440 --> 01:00:37,770
<font size="64">Let me see.</font>

2323
01:00:36,670 --> 01:00:38,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pushing)</font>

2324
01:00:38,210 --> 01:00:40,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He drags what was on the floor behind the line.)</font>

2325
01:00:40,940 --> 01:00:43,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Early Running Man education)</font>

2326
01:00:42,080 --> 01:00:43,310
<font size="64">That doesn't count. He kicked it in.</font>

2327
01:00:43,850 --> 01:00:45,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A keen eye)</font>

2328
01:00:43,950 --> 01:00:45,750
<font size="64">- Not the wet wipes. Those three. - No?</font>

2329
01:00:45,750 --> 01:00:47,580
<font size="64">How many points? Ten...</font>

2330
01:00:45,880 --> 01:00:48,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(2 points, 9 points, 1 point)</font>

2331
01:00:47,580 --> 01:00:48,950
<font size="64">Twelve points.</font>

2332
01:00:48,850 --> 01:00:52,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hyun Jung earns 12 points.)</font>

2333
01:00:48,950 --> 01:00:50,720
<font size="64">- Twelve points. - Don't count this.</font>

2334
01:00:50,720 --> 01:00:53,420
<font size="64">It worked because he has a long reach.</font>

2335
01:00:52,350 --> 01:00:55,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His long arms broke through Min Jong's barricade.)</font>

2336
01:00:53,890 --> 01:00:56,590
<font size="64">- How did he get that big one? - He has long arms.</font>

2337
01:00:56,590 --> 01:00:57,960
<font size="64">- The thing is... - I'll go next.</font>

2338
01:00:57,390 --> 01:00:59,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Next is Jae Seok.)</font>

2339
01:00:57,960 --> 01:00:59,760
<font size="64">- Once you push through... - Jae Seok?</font>

2340
01:00:59,660 --> 01:01:03,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A tip from an experienced player)</font>

2341
01:00:59,760 --> 01:01:01,230
<font size="64">Once you're pulled back, you can't go again.</font>

2342
01:01:01,230 --> 01:01:03,400
<font size="64">- You have one go. - Grab while you're there?</font>

2343
01:01:03,500 --> 01:01:04,570
<font size="64">Don't go in there.</font>

2344
01:01:03,530 --> 01:01:05,570
